  It is a perfectly legal and perfectly sound transaction. The paper is good, and the discount is large, and in a year it will be at par. Bartolo does not know what is being done, for a day or two, and when he does he writes you a very short and very courteous letter, and it is not a letter that is meant to be answered. You put it in the strong room with the rest of the paper. It is good paper.
