# clerk
## The river stair
$ do chart("florence.bank")
The river is low and slow and the color of pewter. It is the hour when the washerwomen's boards are empty, and the lamp at the end of the Ponte alle Grazie makes a thin yellow track on the water. The clerk is on the third step with the little book shut on a knee, and a coat that is too thin, and a face that looks as if it had been scrubbed with a cloth. {watcher.They} {watcher.have} been waiting for some time.
?if b2.watcher_bond == "begun"
  ~> clerk_close
?else
  ~> clerk_cool
?end
<~

# clerk_close
{watcher.They} get{watcher.s} up when {watcher.they} see{watcher.s} you. It is a small, odd, abrupt thing to do, as if someone had been caught out in a weakness, and then it is not abrupt at all, and {watcher.they} {watcher.are} very close, with a hand against your sleeve, saying nothing. The river goes by. It is quite a long time before {watcher.they} speak.
"I have been asked a question," says {watcher.they}. "By the house in Pisa. It has been put to me in a very polite letter. They wish to know whether I think that it is a thing which will end well." There is a small unsteady breath. "I did not know what to say. I think that I should like to know what I am to say."
:the_clerk_close
* Tell {watcher.them} the whole of it, the faction and the Sunday and what you mean to do
  $ b2.watcher_night = "told"
  $ bond.watcher += 3
  $ secrecy -= 2
  $ humanity += 1
  You tell {watcher.them}. It takes a long time, on the cold stair, with the river going by, and {watcher.they} listen{watcher.s} with {watcher.their} eyes shut. At the end {watcher.they} {watcher.are} quiet. "Then I shall write that it is a thing which has not yet ended," says {watcher.they}, very low, "and that I do not know how it will." {watcher.They} put{watcher.s} {watcher.their} forehead against your shoulder for a moment. "That is the first honest thing that I have put in a letter in three years."
* Say that you do not know how it ends, and that {watcher.they} must write whatever is true
  $ b2.watcher_night = "kept"
  $ bond.watcher += 1
  $ secrecy += 1
  "That is a perfectly fair answer," says {watcher.they}, after a moment, in a voice which is not entirely steady. "It is not the one I hoped for." {watcher.They} take{watcher.s} {watcher.their} hand off your sleeve, quite slowly, and put{watcher.s} it in {watcher.their} pocket. "I shall write that I was told nothing, and that it was a very great deal."
