  There is a very long silence. It is the first time that you have seen {watcher.them} quite lost for a word. "I did not expect it," says {watcher.they}, at last, with a small unsteady laugh, and the sound is a surprising one. "I shall have to think of something to put in the letter. I do not at all know what." You say that you will think of it together.
